      "text": "Always carrying squared logs, they help out with construction. As they grow, they carry bigger logs.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It loves helping out with construction projects. It loves it so much that if rain causes work to halt, it swings its log around and throws a tantrum.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Timburr that have started carrying logs that are about three times their size are nearly ready to evolve.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
